OL,3,AAustralian murderer loses bid to eat
OL,4,AVegemite in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted murderer serving a life
OL,7,Fsentence in Australia has lost his bid
OL,8,Fto overturn a ban on prisoners
OL,9,Fconsuming Vegemite - the salty
OL,10,Fyeast-based spread that has become a
OL,11,Fnational symbol.
OL,13,FAndre McKechnie argued that the ban, in
OL,14,Fplace since 2006, denied him the right
OL,15,Fto "enjoy his culture as an
OL,16,FAustralian".
OL,18,FAuthorities in the state of Victoria
OL,19,Fsay inmates may use the strong-smelling
OL,20,Fpaste to disguise contraband substances
OL,21,For to brew alcohol behind bars.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
