OL,3,AAustralian murderer loses bid to eat
OL,4,AVegemite in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd on Monday, a Supreme Court judge
OL,7,Frejected McKechnie's appeal, saying the
OL,8,Fprisoner's "cultural rights are limited
OL,9,Fprimarily by the fact he has been
OL,10,Fsentenced to a term of imprisonment".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
